/// A bar panel: renders what arrives on `messages`, wakes itself on `tick`.
///
/// It holds `dom` because it draws: a message area rebuilt from the block tree
/// its body convention parses to, and a status line carrying the drop and
/// malformed-body counters.
///
/// Its priority slots, its view handles and the last render it diffs against
/// ride the retained `state` port between activations, because linear memory
/// does not.
component Protobar {
  abi = processor;
  requires = [ports, log, dom];
  in messages: "brenn.panel.message@1";
  io tick;
  io state;
}
